    "main_topic": [
      {
        "h_title": "KHAOSOK",
        "main_title": "KHAOSOK",
        "author": "Khao Sok",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Khao Sok National Park in Southern Thailand is an amazing place. It is covered by the oldest evergreen rainforest in the world, huge limestone mountains shooting straight up in the air, deep valleys, breathtaking lakes, exciting caves, wild animals and much more.",
            "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/photos/nature/",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/photos/nature/",
                "anchor_text": "breathtaking lakes"
              },
              {
                "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/fauna/",
                "anchor_text": "wild animals"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Khao Sok is perfectly situated on the mainland between Phuket, Krabi, Khao Lak and Koh Samui, the most popular destinations in Southern Thailand. It is a fantastic place to go on vacation. Close and personal elephant encounters, jungle trekking on foot and canoeing are all possible activities, which will give you the experience of a lifetime.",
            "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/photos/activities/",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/photos/activities/",
                "anchor_text": "activities"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "One of the most interesting areas is stunningly beautiful Cheow Larn Lake in the heart of the National Park with its floating raft houses and luxury tents – an absolute must-see! As the diversity Khao Sok has to offer can be quite overwhelming at first, we collected a few recommended tours for you, which will take you to visit various locations in Khao Sok.",
            "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/recommended-tours/",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/recommended-tours/",
                "anchor_text": "recommended tours"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Ideal for nature lovers of any age",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Family friendly jungle and lake safari",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Great for budding jungle enthusiasts",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Ultimate Khao Sok Adventure",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Perfect for couples and honeymooners",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Many are drawn to Khao Sok to behold its natural beauty, but the adventure doesn’t stop there. Delve into a variety of activities offered by local tour operators and guest houses, ensuring a memorable experience beyond the scenic allure.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "In addition to recommended tours, Khaosok.com features information on the vast variety of flora and fauna in Khao Sok, as well as facts and history about the area. We aim to promote and preserve Khao Sok by making you appreciate this beautiful area just as much as we do. Should you have any question on the National Park, please feel free to contact us.",
            "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/recommended-tours/",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/recommended-tours/",
                "anchor_text": "recommended tours"
              },
              {
                "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/facts/",
                "anchor_text": "facts"
              },
              {
                "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/history/",
                "anchor_text": "history"
              },
              {
                "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/contact-us/",
                "anchor_text": "contact us"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Have a wonderful time at Khao Sok!",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Khao Sok’s landscape is a blend of tropical evergreen forest and rainforest, hosting about 200 different floral species per hectare, marking it as a biodiverse haven. This rich habitat welcomes an array of diligent and astonishing wildlife, including 48 mammal species, 311 bird species, over 30 bat species, and a plethora of reptiles and insects, showcasing a vibrant tapestry of life in every corner.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
